{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","name_native":"সুনান আন-নাসায়ী","section":{"51":"The Book of Drinks"},"section_detail":{"51":{"hadithnumber_first":5540,"hadithnumber_last":5758,"arabicnumber_first":5540,"arabicnumber_last":5758,"name_native":"পানীয় অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":5758,"arabicnumber":5758,"text":"ইসহাক ইবন ইব্রাহীম (রহঃ) থেকে বর্ণিত। তিনি বলেন, জারীর (রহঃ) আমাদের বলেছেন, ইবন শুবরুমা (রহঃ) শুধু পানি এবং দুধ পান করতেন।","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih Isnaad Maqtu"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad Maqtu"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":51,"hadith":220}}]}